# Rituály listing

`/svatebni-ritualy` uses `Sections/ritualy.twig`.

## Layout

- Intro reuses homepage text hero (`.home-hero.home-hero--text`): kicker, title, longer lead, blurb, CTA → kontakt (“Napsat o rituálu”)
- Wedding cards reuse `.home-plot` peeking photos (3:2 cover, outer-edge crop, print shadow, ≤0.5° tilt)
- Panels in a greige grid: **max 2 columns** from 801px (never 3); `.75rem` white gaps
- Prefer landscape listing images via `Post::getPreferredImage("landscape")`
- Title = newlywed names from materialize; summary = crafted perex
- No scroll / entrance animations
